{"last_link_id": 50, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["## 这是「API 批量版」工作流"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "API 批量版说明", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#20303d", "size": [1300, 420], "pos": [40, 40], "id": 1, "properties": {"bgcolor": "#20303d", "color": "#e9f2f8", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "value": "# 👉 四步出片\n**① 贴图** → 左侧「① 参考图」：图1 = 主体人物（最重要），图2/3 = 场景/道具/光线。用不到的 Ctrl+B 屏蔽。\n**② 写提示词** → 中间「③ 提示词」框：图1 是谁 → 什么场景 → 什么动作 → 说什么台词，80–200 字。\n**③ 选比例 / 分辨率 / 时长** → 提示词下方三个控件：\n　· 画面比例：`16:9 (Widescreen)` 横屏 / `9:16 (Portrait Widescreen)` 竖屏 / 1:1 …\n　· 分辨率：16:9 可选 **864×480（480P）**、1280×736（720P）、1920×1088（1080P）；9:16 对应 480×864 / 736×1280 / 1088×1920。**先小档抽卡，满意再换大档**。\n　· 时长：填帧数 **124≈5秒 / 192≈8秒 / 260≈11秒 / 328≈14秒**（24fps，必须是 17n+5，后面 `时长校正` 节点会自动修正）。\n**④ 点右上角「运行」**（选 **Lite/Standard** 档，便宜）。\n\n> 9 张图不够：用「② 拼图」区把多张拼成 2×2 占第 9 槽。模型上限 = 9图 + 3视频 + 3音频。"}, "order": 0, "widgets_values_named": {"text": "## 这是「API 批量版」工作流"}}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [5], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [325, 370], "pos": [60, 440], "widgets_values": ["4dddeda5d729c8cabe864777da4c0c7d2672b1f291eae04e3f2c706ac8c5c2e1.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "id": 2, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 1, "widgets_values_named": {"image": "4dddeda5d729c8cabe864777da4c0c7d2672b1f291eae04e3f2c706ac8c5c2e1.png", "upload": "image"}}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [6], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}],